    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our reality is over there as well. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the story of our faves in the other world and us in this world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our cheering becomes light, transcends the walls of the real world, and eventually resonates through to the world over there, where our faves are. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our faves are indeed there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The sight, voice, and even the breathing of our faves will lead us on an adventure beyond our imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Yes, our reality is over there as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience various contents such as live music performances and music videos by virtual characters such as Vtubers and Vsingers in VR. Switch the camera to enjoy various angles and screenshot your favorite moments. Dive into the world of your faves and enjoy the realistic experience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our reality is over there as well. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the story of our faves in the other world and us in this world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our cheering becomes light, transcends the walls of the real world, and eventually resonates through to the world over there, where our faves are. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our faves are indeed there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The sight, voice, and even the breathing of our faves will lead us on an adventure beyond our imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Yes, our reality is over there as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience various contents such as live music performances and music videos by virtual characters such as Vtubers and Vsingers in VR. Switch the camera to enjoy various angles and screenshot your favorite moments. Dive into the world of your faves and enjoy the realistic experience.</p>",
    "short_description": "Experience various contents such as live music performances and music videos by virtual characters such as Vtubers and Vsingers in VR. Switch the camera to enjoy various angles and screenshot your favorite moments. Dive into the world of your faves and enjoy the realistic experience.",
